        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The graph below shows the changes in the birth rates for women in 6 different age groups in the UK from 1973 to 2008. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRGtdUu8Yoj6sgxAX1TldD5sgBh\"><strong><em>The graph below shows the changes in the birth rates for women in 6 different age groups in the UK from 1973 to 2008.</em></strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Utr1ds4Rwo7dr9xLvfNlg2iZguH\"><strong><em>Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</em></strong></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - UK Birth Rates: 1973&ndash;2008</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlDbd2qAnoIMNuxhwitlQ2RmgRb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/task-1-line-charts\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Giới thiệu dạng Line Graphs</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RPkzdJzsBou4UDxr4CRlmW1dgOf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i UK Birth Rates: 1973&ndash;2008 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả sự thay đổi trong tỷ lệ sinh của phụ nữ thuộc 6 nh&oacute;m tuổi kh&aacute;c nhau ở Anh, từ năm 1973 đến năm 2008.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AEvkdTyGzo0BRnx5ZN6lCZ80gwg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuyet-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tuyệt đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr; đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V8dPdPvftovhR1xJ5cdlR0ivgre\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề UK Birth Rates: 1973&ndash;2008 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: tỷ lệ sinh tr&ecirc;n 1000 người - từ 1973 đến 2008.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UNkqd89CNo1qxixBCuSlx0EUgCc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Học c&aacute;ch viết Introduction</strong> cho <strong>tất cả</strong> c&aacute;c b&agrave;i dạng <strong>Line Graphs</strong> ở đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute; &rarr;<strong> </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-line\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">C&aacute;ch viết Introduction dạng LINE</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IFf1dMjRDok8HtxlXSUlI37OgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PES6dseoLobP1kxm8GSljpAcgZe\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dm3sdzaI3ospG1xnKv7lxbtTgMe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends:</strong> trong khi<strong> </strong>tỷ lệ sinh của phụ nữ trong hai nh&oacute;m từ 30-35 v&agrave; từ 35-39 tăng đều, tỷ lệ n&agrave;y ở c&aacute;c nh&oacute;m trẻ hơn giảm mạnh</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCTldywH9oQJW7xCZ1VlUdJKg4d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>Phụ nữ từ 25-29 lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; tỷ lệ sinh cao nhất</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-APeudfcnGokeKfxzDvQl1ZTYg0b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZKeidNvRUomf1bx5BFDlwhvEgTf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZKeidNvRUomf1bx5BFDlwhvEgTf\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ag5CdNVfXoWE9IxqVyIlRycXgSy\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GAUidqYKao7ygwxYDXylDbSHgnb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> P</strong><strong>hụ nữ từ 20-25, 25-29, v&agrave; 30-35</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QhkgdIDmZoiKSFx6txilWrGmgVc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QhkgdIDmZoiKSFx6txilWrGmgVc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VsxRdUk4MoiOOIxZF13lIFnAgsh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1973 </strong><em>(Nh&oacute;m 25-29 c&oacute; 140 ca sinh tr&ecirc;n 1000 người, </em><em>theo sau</em><em> l&agrave; nh&oacute;m 20-25 với 130 ca sinh, </em><em>trong khi</em><em> số ca ở nh&oacute;m 30-35 l&agrave; 70)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OYm0dvnMToTxW6x0GqqlfyGDgoh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng giai đoạn c&ograve;n lại của nh&oacute;m 25-29 </strong><em>(</em><em>mặc d&ugrave;</em><em> vẫn l&agrave; nh&oacute;m c&oacute; tỷ lệ sinh cao nhất, nhưng số ca sinh </em><em><strong>giảm mạnh</strong></em><em> v&agrave; <strong>dao động</strong> trong l&uacute;c giảm, </em><em>kết th&uacute;c</em><em> ở mức 120 ca sinh v&agrave;o năm 2008)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GX3MdG8aMoQ0WbxgRZmlc2JRgvb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng v&agrave; so s&aacute;nh nh&oacute;m 20-25 v&agrave; nh&oacute;m 30-35 </strong><em>(Nh&oacute;m 20-25 </em><em><strong>giảm đều </strong></em><em>về mức 92 ca sinh v&agrave;o năm 2008, </em><em>ngược lại</em><em>, nh&oacute;m 30-35 </em><em><strong>tăng đều</strong></em><em>, </em><em>đạt mức</em><em> 88 ca sinh v&agrave;o năm 2008)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CMAGdlHtOoSFpCx9IcOlPJTJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Anild0KgDodr4CxaGVxlsOo5g9g\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DH94du72woQl9sxlXsSli3lUgjg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Phụ nữ dưới 20, từ 35-39, v&agrave; 40 trở l&ecirc;n.</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DH94du72woQl9sxlXsSli3lUgjg\">\n<div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T1RUdFoD6oAdfExmPGqlJinog8c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XqUndSOk5oFyzQxWqlVlEYiHgBb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1973 của nh&oacute;m dưới 20 v&agrave; 35-39 năm 1973 </strong><em>(Nh&oacute;m dưới 20 v&agrave; 35-39 c&oacute; 60 v&agrave; 40 ca sinh tr&ecirc;n 1000 người)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SVaqda9lCoQGISxTjmglwinOg8d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng giai đoạn c&ograve;n lại của nh&oacute;m dưới 20 v&agrave; 35-39 </strong><em>(Số ca sinh của nh&oacute;m dưới 20 </em><em><strong>giảm mạnh</strong></em><em> xuống mức 35 v&agrave;o năm 2008,<strong> </strong></em><em>trong khi</em><em> nh&oacute;m 35-39 </em><em><strong>tăng l&ecirc;n</strong></em><em> 65 ca)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J7xfdpqlnoR652xRUwSlnukpgJe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của nh&oacute;m tr&ecirc;n 40 </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>duy tr&igrave;</strong></em><em> ở mức thấp nhất, bắt đầu ở mức dưới 20 ca sinh v&agrave; </em><em><strong>giảm xuống</strong></em><em> 5 ca v&agrave;o năm 2008)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MCTSdfVoroHeaZxLkfllocxrgic\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OX8Zd3idvoODJ3xVNlkliKYLgwe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi muốn diễn đạt việc \"<strong>nh&oacute;m phụ nữ dưới 20 tuổi</strong>\", thay v&igrave; d&ugrave;ng\"<strong>woman under 20</strong>\", m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng \"<strong>the youngest group</strong>\" để c&acirc;u văn của m&igrave;nh đa dạng hơn nh&eacute;.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OX8Zd3idvoODJ3xVNlkliKYLgwe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AYkXdpGrVo1vDXxoTXilplJOgcd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PWVSdXGZ9oBzBVxjL2nlXAs5gfd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Both <strong>women under 20</strong> and those aged 35-39 began with similar birth rates of about 60 and 40 births per 1,000 people respectively in 1973.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Aa7bdVMOCoKNY5xPsErlGTZBgPg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>The youngest group</strong> experienced a significant decline</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
