            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xs0RdCsD1oY12MxT8TnlqbTNg54\">Overall, while birth rates among women aged 30-35 and 35-39 increased steadily, those for younger women under 25 declined significantly. Additionally, women aged 25-29 consistently maintained the highest birth rates.</div>\n</div>",
